{
  "id": "PRO.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear, ye children, the instruction of a father, and attend to know understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I give you good doctrine, forsake ye not my law.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I was my father's son, tender and only",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "beloved",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the sight of my mother.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He taught me also, and said unto me, Let thine heart retain my words: keep my commandments, and live.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Get wisdom, get understanding: forget",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not; neither decline from the words of my mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Forsake her not, and she shall preserve thee: love her, and she shall keep thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wisdom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the principal thing;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "therefore",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "get wisdom: and with all thy getting get understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Exalt her, and she shall promote thee: she shall bring thee to honour, when thou dost embrace her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She shall give to thine head an ornament of grace: a crown of glory shall she deliver to thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear, O my son, and receive my sayings; and the years of thy life shall be many.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have taught thee in the way of wisdom; I have led thee in right paths.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When thou goest, thy steps shall not be straitened; and when thou runnest, thou shalt not stumble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take fast hold of instruction; let",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "her",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not go: keep her; for she",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy life.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Enter not into the path of the wicked, and go not in the way of evil",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avoid it, pass not by it, turn from it, and pass away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they sleep not, except they have done mischief; and their sleep is taken away, unless they cause",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "some",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to fall.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they eat the bread of wickedness, and drink the wine of violence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the path of the just",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as the shining light, that shineth more and more unto the perfect day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The way of the wicked",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as darkness: they know not at what they stumble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ My son, attend to my words; incline thine ear unto my sayings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them not depart from thine eyes; keep them in the midst of thine heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "life unto those that find them, and health to all their flesh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Keep thy heart with all diligence; for out of it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.4.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.4.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the issues of life.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put away from thee a froward mouth, and perverse lips put far from thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let thine eyes look right on, and let thine eyelids look straight before thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ponder the path of thy feet, and let all thy ways be established.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.26"
            ]
